></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">基</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>基础；根本；（化学）基；（机器量词）台</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">もと・もとい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">基</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もと</span><span class=\"k-wz\">起源；源头；开端；基础；基底；根基；根本；原因；起因；（原）材料；原料；配料；底料（如蛋糕用）；高汤；己方；自己一边；本金；本钱；成本价；（植物的）根；（树的）主干；（笔、筷子等的）握持部分；柄部；和歌的前三句；（植物或树木的计数单位）株；棵；（鹰猎中鹰的计数单位）只</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">基本</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きほん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">基础；基本；根基；基本原理</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">基づく</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もとづく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">以...为基础；以...为依据；符合于；遵照；源于；出自；由...引起；来自于</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">価</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>价值；价格</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カ・ケ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あたい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">価格</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かかく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">价格；价值；成本</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">価値</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">价值；优点</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">高価</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">昂贵；高价；贵重；值钱</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">提</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>提出；携带；手提</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テイ・チョウ・ダイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さ.げる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">提案</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ていあん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">提案；建议；议案</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">提出</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ていしゅつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">提交（文件、申请等）；呈交；递交；出示（证据）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">前提</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぜんてい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">条件；假设；前提条件；意图；意向；目的；目标；（逻辑）前提（推理所依据的命题）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">挙</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>举起；计划；行为；项目；聚集</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あ.げる・あ.がる・こぞ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">挙げる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あげる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">列举；例举；显示；展示；引用；鼓起；汇聚；聚集；逮捕；捉拿；抓获；拘捕；提名；推荐；提议；建议；举办；举行；进行；主持；起义；举兵；武装反抗；公布；宣扬；传播；成名；生育；生养；抚养；养育；抬起；举起；提高；升高；发出；提高；扬起（嗓音）；赢得；获得；取得；达到</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">選挙</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せんきょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">选举</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">一挙に</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いっきょに</span><span class=\"k-wz\">一举；一下子；一口气</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">応</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>回答；应允；接受；适用；应对</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読